Prior art / technique class for Vibe Vision (1.1):
Random-dot kinematograms and motion-coherence illusions are a long-standing
perception technique. Recent consumer demos of this class exist for frontier-model
testing. VCL VibeBench's Vibe Vision is an original implementation of the general
technique — not a fork of any third-party product, never branded as a third-party
name, and MIT-licensed (fork and modify).
